{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d76MWCR3O21795408425.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前圓滿舉行，一眾花旦當晚均悉心打扮爭妍鬥麗。向來擁有高䠷身形與出眾氣質的花旦劉穎鏇（Tiffany），當晚便挑選了一襲酒紅色晚裝華麗赴會，大晒招牌長腿；她事後更於社交平台分享一段台慶造型花絮短片，拍下自己在電視城古裝街及教堂遊走的迷人身影，十分靚女。</p><p><p><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1795250916_4035177796065661414_193721100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265dvWiTaDh41795408368.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1795250916_4035177764700670804_193721100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZURGGhq1Kh1795408376.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-23-12h27m38s998.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fWaXh1kGm31795408391.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:30:22.871496+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:37:11.800308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:23:50.851563+00:00","content_hash":"88f38c21b2a08be5eaca710564601d09abeb29b936ad9fd931d2a56f20da1d3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:30:22.871496+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}